- **Signature system, Switch Network:** track points are physics levers and the yard is a directed graph. Players route a handcar (or the train) to the exit track; wrong routes dead-end at buffer stops or derail at speed. The turntable needs power or a two-person crank.
- **Salvage:** intact cars can be coupled and towed away as Car Blocks for customization (Tankers store fuel, Boxcars add storage, Flatcars carry hardpoints).
